 @brief Opcode 0x5F - **WAIT1* - Wait 1 frame

 Memory layout:

 | 0x5F |
 @details
 Waits one frame and returns 1
 @note
 This does not emit a debug message.
 */
s32 OpcodeFuncWait1(void) {
